    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 13 - RAG Knowledge Agent (Supabase)\nAsk your company files in Arabic and get answers **with the source**.\n\n**Indexing (top):** new files in a Drive folder, or uploads from the form, are downloaded, split into 1000-char chunks with overlap, embedded and stored in Supabase pgvector with metadata (file name, link, department).\n\n**Chat (bottom):** a public chat page. The agent always searches the knowledge base first, answers only from retrieved text, says clearly when the answer is not in the documents, and cites file names. Conversation memory keeps follow-up questions in context.\n\n**Setup:** run `supabase-setup.sql` once in Supabase SQL editor.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
